["TOOL_CATALOG_V6", "TOOL_CATALOG", 6, "CODE_OWNED", "{\"absent_tools\":[],\"id\":\"TOOL_CATALOG_V6\",\"kind\":\"TOOL_CATALOG\",\"queued_status\":\"ACCEPTED\",\"source\":\"docs/AGENT_TOOL_CONTRACTS.md M10 tool catalog v6 and ExecPlan 0033 section 5.2\",\"status\":\"CODE_OWNED\",\"tools\":[{\"arguments\":[\"view\",\"as_of\"],\"description\":\"view MARKET: the market-only least-data view at the job cutoff, as in catalog v2. view PORTFOLIO (COORDINATOR in a decision; EVALUATOR in an intent review): the portfolio snapshot stored once when the decision workflow started, with its hash and state key; every read in the workflow returns the same snapshot and as_of must be null. Any other view, or PORTFOLIO in another workflow, is refused.\",\"effect\":\"READ\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"get_snapshot\"},{\"arguments\":[\"symbol\",\"feature_ids\",\"window_hours\",\"as_of\"],\"description\":\"Registered features over finalized 1h candles for one coin of this job's symbols, evaluated at the last finalized bar at or before as_of (default: the job cutoff). feature_ids: 1-6 registered IDs; window_hours: 1-168 (OHLCV_1H_V1: at most 72). Returns exact decimal strings with inputs, warm-up and quality.\",\"effect\":\"READ\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"query_market_features\"},{\"arguments\":[\"artifact_id\"],\"description\":\"Reads one typed artifact in this workflow's scope, or one evidence item that a result of this workflow or an artifact in its scope returned. Any other ID is refused. What a role may not see is withheld: a tuning role gets only the verdict and deficiency codes of a review that consulted holdout or shadow results.\",\"effect\":\"READ\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"read_artifact\"},{\"arguments\":[\"search_scope\",\"query\",\"source_id\",\"symbol\",\"limit\"],\"description\":\"ANALYST. Plain-term search of approved evidence. search_scope SOURCES returns at most 10 items of sources in force that were available by the job cutoff; ARTIFACTS returns references to earlier typed artifacts. source_id and symbol narrow a SOURCES search; the sources in force are filed under BTCUSDT and SOLUSDT, so a search narrowed to another coin finds nothing. Each returned item can be cited by its ID. Never a URL or a web search.\",\"effect\":\"READ\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"search_evidence\"},{\"arguments\":[\"source_id\",\"filters\"],\"description\":\"ANALYST and RESEARCHER. Queues one fetch of a registered, approved source by its ID, with that source's typed integer filters. Never a URL, host or path. Returns ACCEPTED with a request reference; the workflow then waits and resumes with one completion.\",\"effect\":\"QUEUE_SOURCE_REFRESH\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"request_source_refresh\"},{\"arguments\":[\"intent\"],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR in a decision workflow. Records one immutable draft of ENTER, EXIT, CANCEL_ENTRY or TIGHTEN_STOP for one coin of the policy in force (the job's symbols). Every choice is a member of the policy's set in the job context: expiry_minutes always; for ENTER exposure_fraction, stop_multiple (decimal text as listed) and max_hold_hours, with entry_basis ASSESSMENT and basis_ref a reviewed brief in scope that covers the coin, or entry_basis CANDIDATE and basis_ref an approved candidate in scope whose stop_multiple and max_hold_hours the entry takes; for TIGHTEN_STOP the tightening template. position_id names a live position for EXIT and TIGHTEN_STOP. A price, quantity, stop level, fee or balance is never an argument. Returns the draft's ID and hash. At most two drafts a workflow.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_INTENT_DRAFT\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"draft_trade_intent\"},{\"arguments\":[\"intent_id\"],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR. Starts the intent review of one of this workflow's drafts, bound to the draft's, the policy's and the snapshot's hashes. Returns ACCEPTED with the review reference; the workflow then waits and resumes with the review's verdict. A second request for the same draft returns the first.\",\"effect\":\"QUEUE_REVIEW\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"request_review\"},{\"arguments\":[\"intent_id\",\"review_id\"],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR. Submits one of this workflow's drafts to the execution engine. An ENTER needs its ACCEPTABLE intent review (review_id); any other action may carry one. Checked now: the policy approved and its run live, the draft unexpired, its decision bar still the latest, the review bound to it and to the current state, the basis still valid, nothing else of this workflow outstanding. Returns ACCEPTED with the submission reference; the workflow then waits and resumes with the engine's answer. The engine checks everything again against current state and may refuse.\",\"effect\":\"QUEUE_MAIN_INTENT\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"submit_trade_intent\"},{\"arguments\":[\"pause_reason\",\"pause_cites\"],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR in a decision workflow. Requests the discretionary entry pause with one enumerated reason and 1-8 cited records of this workflow. Existing positions keep their protection; only the owner resumes entries.\",\"effect\":\"QUEUE_ENTRY_PAUSE\",\"finish_only\":false,\"name\":\"request_entry_pause\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"ANALYST only, through FINISH with finish.assessment. Records an immutable MarketAssessment; it may name one research question.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_assessment\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"EVALUATOR only, through FINISH with finish.review. Records an immutable EvaluationReview bound to the exact target hash: an assessment, a draft (with the policy's and the snapshot's hashes) or an outcome record.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_review\"},{\"arguments\":[],\"description\":\"COORDINATOR only, through FINISH with finish.decision. Records the immutable PortfolioDecision: per symbol the action taken or none, the draft it names, the reason code, and whether the owner's review is asked for. The server writes what became of each draft.\",\"effect\":\"RECORD_AGENT_ARTIFACT\",\"finish_only\":true,\"name\":\"record_decision\"}],\"unknown_tool\":\"UNKNOWN_TOOL\",\"version\":6}", "72f171adb17093285b515c05be56d6a70454d66d4532c261ff5a942e77a383fd"]
